sequenceDiagram
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Upload as Upload Validator
    participant Analyzer as Music Analyzer
    participant Review as Feature Validator
    participant Catalog as Private Catalog
    participant Index as Retrieval Index

    Listener->>UI: Select owned or permitted audio
    UI->>API: Upload for temporary analysis
    API->>Upload: Validate signature, size, duration
    alt Invalid file
        Upload-->>UI: Safe validation error
    else Valid file
        Upload->>Analyzer: Normalized temporary audio
        Analyzer-->>Review: Measurements, estimates, provenance
        Review-->>UI: Reviewable feature proposal
        Listener->>UI: Correct and approve values
        UI->>API: Confirm canonical song
        API->>Catalog: Save private song and provenance
        Catalog->>Index: Index approved song document
        Index-->>UI: Song available for recommendations
        API->>Upload: Delete temporary audio
    end
